+
+// afree multi_display (multi-screen same-view): multi-surface fan-out.
+//
+// One decode source -> one texture -> draw to N surfaces (one per display),
+// using a single EGL context. This is the "M3a" building block: it is driven
+// with a test pattern first (validated on display 0 with two SurfaceViews),
+// then fed real decoded video frames (M3b).
+//
+// Only compiled when the GN arg afree_multi_display=true.
+
